-- ############################################################################################################
-- Part O: DISCARD XREFS and DROP TABLE remove the subscript cross references and their triggers
# Expected: no subscript cross reference and no AIM trigger on ^RWK after DISCARD XREFS and after DROP TABLE;
# the cross reference of rwk.b and its triggers again after a query builds it.
# Before DISCARD XREFS
#   Globals with an AIM subscript cross reference: ^ANC ^BC ^BE ^BI ^BP ^BS ^GXRF ^RWK ^STK ^T3 ^TRL
#   AIM triggers on ^RWK: 5
OCTO> DISCARD XREFS;
OCTO> 
# After DISCARD XREFS
#   Globals with an AIM subscript cross reference:
#   AIM triggers on ^RWK: 0
